WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.775
In-File searches indexed document text

00:00:03.775 --> 00:00:10.998
Type text that appears inside the document

00:00:10.998 --> 00:00:19.712
Read Match snippets to identify the right result

00:00:19.712 --> 00:00:26.018
The preview highlights visible matches

00:00:26.018 --> 00:00:37.998
Use the find arrows to move between matches

00:00:37.998 --> 00:00:43.999
Scroll or change pages without opening the source

00:00:43.999 --> 00:00:52.400
Use a distinctive phrase for fewer results

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.999
Text and documents share the same preview pane

00:00:56.999 --> 00:01:00.000
Files finds the name. In-File finds the content.
